{
  "_doc": [
    "Shared test vectors for the scan rules in docs/opticloud-scans.md (Rules). The station app",
    "(apps/station/tests, ScanRulesVectorsTests) and the reports site (apps/web) both run every case,",
    "so the operators' screen and the web report pair scans the same way. Change a rule here first.",
    "",
    "Each case: name; now, todayStart (local midnight of now, as a UTC instant) and windowStart",
    "(now - 36h) as ISO 8601 UTC; events in, in any order; expected out.",
    "An event is one VentisolScans row: id (ScanId), barcode (12 digits), stationNo, station (name),",
    "stationKind (Assembly | Packing), direction (In | Out), time (ScanTime), durationSec (number or null).",
    "",
    "To run a case: drop events with time < windowStart (they are never read), pair the rest by the",
    "rules, then compare:",
    "  done: the work records that end today (end >= todayStart), each {barcode, stationNo, start, end};",
    "       compare sorted by end, then stationNo, then barcode.",
    "  inProgress: per station, its latest In with no Out, over the whole window, each",
    "       {stationNo, barcode, since}; at most one per station; compare sorted by stationNo.",
    "Times compare as instants (same millisecond), not as strings."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "an In and its Out make one record",
      "now": "2026-10-21T10:00:00Z", "todayStart": "2026-10-20T22:00:00Z", "windowStart": "2026-10-19T22:00:00Z",
      "events": [
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000002", "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "station": "Station 10", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "Out", "time": "2026-10-21T06:12:00Z", "durationSec": 720 },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000001", "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "station": "Station 10", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "In", "time": "2026-10-21T06:00:00Z", "durationSec": null }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "done": [ { "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "start": "2026-10-21T06:00:00Z", "end": "2026-10-21T06:12:00Z" } ],
        "inProgress": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a second In of the same element at the same station: the later wins",
      "now": "2026-10-21T10:00:00Z", "todayStart": "2026-10-20T22:00:00Z", "windowStart": "2026-10-19T22:00:00Z",
      "events": [
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0002-000000000001", "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "station": "Station 10", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "In", "time": "2026-10-21T06:00:00Z", "durationSec": null },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0002-000000000002", "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "station": "Station 10", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "In", "time": "2026-10-21T06:30:00Z", "durationSec": null },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0002-000000000003", "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "station": "Station 10", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "Out", "time": "2026-10-21T06:40:00Z", "durationSec": 600 }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "done": [ { "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "start": "2026-10-21T06:30:00Z", "end": "2026-10-21T06:40:00Z" } ],
        "inProgress": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an Out with no In gets its start back from DurationSec",
      "now": "2026-10-21T10:00:00Z", "todayStart": "2026-10-20T22:00:00Z", "windowStart": "2026-10-19T22:00:00Z",
      "events": [
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000001", "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "station": "Station 10", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "Out", "time": "2026-10-21T06:10:00Z", "durationSec": 600 }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "done": [ { "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "start": "2026-10-21T06:00:00Z", "end": "2026-10-21T06:10:00Z" } ],
        "inProgress": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an Out with no In and no DurationSec is skipped",
      "now": "2026-10-21T10:00:00Z", "todayStart": "2026-10-20T22:00:00Z", "windowStart": "2026-10-19T22:00:00Z",
      "events": [
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0004-000000000001", "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "station": "Station 10", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "Out", "time": "2026-10-21T06:10:00Z", "durationSec": null },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0004-000000000002", "barcode": "058556050102", "stationNo": 1, "station": "Station 10", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "In", "time": "2026-10-21T06:20:00Z", "durationSec": null }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "done": [],
        "inProgress": [ { "stationNo": 1, "barcode": "058556050102", "since": "2026-10-21T06:20:00Z" } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "pairs by station number, not by name (a station renamed in between)",
      "now": "2026-10-21T10:00:00Z", "todayStart": "2026-10-20T22:00:00Z", "windowStart": "2026-10-19T22:00:00Z",
      "events": [
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0005-000000000001", "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "station": "Station 10", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "In", "time": "2026-10-21T06:00:00Z", "durationSec": null },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0005-000000000002", "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "station": "Station 11", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "Out", "time": "2026-10-21T06:05:00Z", "durationSec": 300 },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0005-000000000003", "barcode": "058556050102", "stationNo": 2, "station": "Station 10", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "Out", "time": "2026-10-21T06:06:00Z", "durationSec": null }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "done": [ { "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "start": "2026-10-21T06:00:00Z", "end": "2026-10-21T06:05:00Z" } ],
        "inProgress": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "in progress at midnight: still in progress in the morning, and done today when it ends today",
      "now": "2026-10-21T10:00:00Z", "todayStart": "2026-10-20T22:00:00Z", "windowStart": "2026-10-19T22:00:00Z",
      "events": [
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0006-000000000001", "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "station": "Station 10", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "In", "time": "2026-10-20T20:00:00Z", "durationSec": null },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0006-000000000002", "barcode": "058556050102", "stationNo": 2, "station": "Station 20", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "In", "time": "2026-10-20T21:00:00Z", "durationSec": null },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0006-000000000003", "barcode": "058556050102", "stationNo": 2, "station": "Station 20", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "Out", "time": "2026-10-21T05:00:00Z", "durationSec": 28800 },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0006-000000000004", "barcode": "058556050101", "stationNo": 3, "station": "Station 30", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "In", "time": "2026-10-20T19:00:00Z", "durationSec": null },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0006-000000000005", "barcode": "058556050101", "stationNo": 3, "station": "Station 30", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "Out", "time": "2026-10-20T20:00:00Z", "durationSec": 3600 }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "done": [ { "barcode": "058556050102", "stationNo": 2, "start": "2026-10-20T21:00:00Z", "end": "2026-10-21T05:00:00Z" } ],
        "inProgress": [ { "stationNo": 1, "barcode": "058556050103", "since": "2026-10-20T20:00:00Z" } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an In older than the window is forgotten; an Out whose In is that old is rebuilt",
      "now": "2026-10-21T10:00:00Z", "todayStart": "2026-10-20T22:00:00Z", "windowStart": "2026-10-19T22:00:00Z",
      "events": [
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0007-000000000001", "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "station": "Station 10", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "In", "time": "2026-10-19T20:00:00Z", "durationSec": null },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0007-000000000002", "barcode": "058556050102", "stationNo": 2, "station": "Station 20", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "In", "time": "2026-10-19T21:00:00Z", "durationSec": null },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0007-000000000003", "barcode": "058556050102", "stationNo": 2, "station": "Station 20", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "Out", "time": "2026-10-21T06:00:00Z", "durationSec": 118800 }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "done": [ { "barcode": "058556050102", "stationNo": 2, "start": "2026-10-19T21:00:00Z", "end": "2026-10-21T06:00:00Z" } ],
        "inProgress": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "packed: an Out at a Packing station and nothing on the order in progress",
      "now": "2026-10-21T10:00:00Z", "todayStart": "2026-10-20T22:00:00Z", "windowStart": "2026-10-19T22:00:00Z",
      "events": [
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0008-000000000001", "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "station": "Station 10", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "In", "time": "2026-10-21T06:00:00Z", "durationSec": null },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0008-000000000002", "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "station": "Station 10", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "Out", "time": "2026-10-21T06:10:00Z", "durationSec": 600 },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0008-000000000003", "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 7, "station": "Pakning", "stationKind": "Packing", "direction": "In", "time": "2026-10-21T06:20:00Z", "durationSec": null },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0008-000000000004", "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 7, "station": "Pakning", "stationKind": "Packing", "direction": "Out", "time": "2026-10-21T06:30:00Z", "durationSec": 600 },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0008-000000000005", "barcode": "058557010101", "stationNo": 7, "station": "Pakning", "stationKind": "Packing", "direction": "In", "time": "2026-10-21T07:00:00Z", "durationSec": null },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0008-000000000006", "barcode": "058557010101", "stationNo": 7, "station": "Pakning", "stationKind": "Packing", "direction": "Out", "time": "2026-10-21T07:05:00Z", "durationSec": 300 },
        { "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0008-000000000007", "barcode": "058557020101", "stationNo": 2, "station": "Station 20", "stationKind": "Assembly", "direction": "In", "time": "2026-10-21T07:10:00Z", "durationSec": null }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "done": [
          { "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 1, "start": "2026-10-21T06:00:00Z", "end": "2026-10-21T06:10:00Z" },
          { "barcode": "058556050103", "stationNo": 7, "start": "2026-10-21T06:20:00Z", "end": "2026-10-21T06:30:00Z" },
          { "barcode": "058557010101", "stationNo": 7, "start": "2026-10-21T07:00:00Z", "end": "2026-10-21T07:05:00Z" }
        ],
        "inProgress": [ { "stationNo": 2, "barcode": "058557020101", "since": "2026-10-21T07:10:00Z" } ]
      }
    },
    {
